      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSpacious two bedroom apartment extending to 66.5 sq.m (716 sq.ft) with designated parking at Phoenix Park Racecourse, Dublin 15. Ideally located beside the Phoenix Park and close to Castleknock Village, transport links, Dublin City Centre and the M50.\n\nSpacious and well laid out two-bedroom, second-floor apartment with designated parking, ideally located within the highly sought-after Phoenix Park Racecourse development in Dublin 15. Extending to approximately 66.5 sq.m (716 sq.ft), No. 7 Phoenix Park Way offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation in an excellent location close to Castleknock Village, the Phoenix Park, Dublin City Centre and the M50.\n\nNo. 7 extends to 66.5 sq.m (716 sq.ft) comprises of an entrance hall, large living room and dining area, well fitted kitchen, main bathroom and two bedrooms, one with ensuite. The property also benefits from one designated car parking space.\n\nPhoenix Park Way enjoys an exceptional residential setting, with the Phoenix Park right on its doorstep and Castleknock Village within easy reach. Residents can enjoy convenient access to a wide range of shopping, dining, sporting and leisure amenities, while Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is also easily accessible.\n\nThe Phoenix Park Racecourse offers an amenity rich lifestyle at an advantageous location, with a Neighbourhood Centre on site, anchored by Londis food hall. Comprising of a 500 sq.m premises which provides residents with a convenient retail amenity including: off-licence, deli and hot food. There is also the Phoenix Park Pharmacy, Nazoo Skin & Beauty who specialise in delivering high quality skincare and beauty services, KB Coffee Shop and the Hair Room. Phoenix Childcare Creche also opened this year which further enhances the offerings available to local residents."
      },
